      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Cienega%2C_New_Mexico"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Archaeologists find water‑catchment features, petroglyphs, and prehistoric room‑block ruins at the former La Cienega Pueblo site.",
